              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Etiyakini ayoŋ ŋakujuwuanisya alokidiama ka ŋaumonokineta alokwap, eyakaun ŋaokot ka akim ta apuru ŋina alalan nooi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.2.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.2.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 2:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "isiryonio akoloŋ cuc, itereŋio elap puu, kikok ŋaokot, eriŋa nyedolo Akoloŋit ŋina apolon nooi ŋina ke Ekapolon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.2.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.2.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 2:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai ituŋanan daadaŋ ŋini enyarit ekiro ŋolo ke Ekapolon, eiunio; anerae eyakaun lomukura Sion ka Yerusalem ŋulu esiyete anakiro a ŋun, ikwapei alimunio Ekapolon, ido ŋice alokidiŋ ŋulu ideun, eruworosi ŋulu erae Ekapolon enyarae.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.2.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.2.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
